WEBVTT

00:09:57.083 --> 00:10:00.424
I had raised concerns with a board member.

00:10:00.448 --> 00:10:02.439
And meanwhile,

00:10:02.463 --> 00:10:08.217
Elizabeth is on the cover
of every major magazine across America.

00:10:08.818 --> 00:10:10.620
So there's one common thread here,

00:10:10.644 --> 00:10:11.794
and that's me.

00:10:12.106 --> 00:10:13.834
Maybe I'm the problem?

00:10:13.858 --> 00:10:15.938
Maybe there's something
that I'm not seeing?

00:10:15.962 --> 00:10:17.644
Maybe I'm the crazy one.

00:10:18.771 --> 00:10:22.520
And this is the part in my story
where I really get lucky.

00:10:22.930 --> 00:10:24.131
I was approached

00:10:24.155 --> 00:10:26.487
by a very talented journalist,
John Carreyrou

00:10:26.511 --> 00:10:28.837
from the Wall Street Journal, and he --